REVERIE-AIM data license
========================

The files in this directory (reverie_aim_train.json.gz,
reverie_aim_val_unseen.json, target_phrases.json) are derived from:

  - REVERIE (Qi et al., CVPR 2020): instructions and target objects
  - REVERIE-CE in the VLN-CE format: episodes
  - MP3D ObjectNav (Habitat): target viewpoints
  - Matterport3D (Chang et al., 3DV 2017): scenes and semantic instance ids

Because they derive from the Matterport3D dataset, they are distributed under
the Matterport3D Terms of Use and the Creative Commons
Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 3.0 United States license
(CC BY-NC-SA 3.0 US), the same terms as the VLN-CE datasets.

  Matterport3D Terms of Use: https://kaldir.vc.in.tum.de/matterport/MP_TOS.pdf
  CC BY-NC-SA 3.0 US:        https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/3.0/us/legalcode

Use is limited to non-commercial academic research. No Matterport3D scene
data (meshes, images) is included; obtain it from Matterport3D after
accepting their Terms of Use.
